          <twe:explanatoryNotes>After a detailed review, it was determined that the 24F-2 fee for Colorado BondShares - A Tax Exempt Fund was calculated incorrectly from 1995 to 2021. Specifically, reinvested dividends were not included in the aggregate sale price of securities sold from 1996 to 2021, the front-end sales load was subtracted from the aggregate sale price of securities sold from 1995 to 2003 and in 2008, and a calculation error regarding a redemption credit occurred in 2017. This payment will correct those errors, including interest on the unpaid balance, that occurred in the fiscal year noted on this form.</twe:explanatoryNotes>
